00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:12.838
JESSE: November 21st,
2021, Waukesha, Wisconsin.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.274
Crowds gathered
along Main Street

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.944
for the town's
annual Christmas parade.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.613 line:0%
Two of my children
have been extremely involved

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.215 line:0%
in the dance team.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.118 line:0%
They have danced
in the parade

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:27.219 line:0%
for quite some time.

00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:30.457 line:0%
It was always
a really happy, fun event.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.959
JESSE: Which should have
been a festive time with family

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:37.530
