a nightmare caught on camera.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:45.071
(screams)

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:46.672
WOMAN 3: Oh, my God!

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:50.209
I remember hearing stuff like,

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:53.446
I don't really know,
some commotion behind me.

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:58.217
(parade music) (screams)

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:01.220
MAN 2: Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.757
It was one of those
where I can still feel

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:08.394
the wind from
his vehicle as he passed me.

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:11.864
JESSE: A red Ford SUV
unexpectedly comes

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:13.833
barreling down the parade route,

00:02:13.966 --> 00:02:15.835
striking multiple people.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.805
Oh, my God!

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.942
This is a Christmas parade
that happened,

00:02:23.075 --> 00:02:26.679
I think it's almost 60 years
that it's been going on.

00:02:26.812 --> 00:02:28.981
And then suddenly
we have an individual that--

00:02:29.114 --> 00:02:31.851
And just...
destroying every memory

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:33.953
anyone's ever gonna
have of that event.

00:02:34.086 --> 00:02:36.289
(screams)

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:39.725
WOMAN 5: What the (beep)!
Oh, my God!

00:02:39.858 --> 00:02:42.428
Oh, my God! Oh, my God.

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:44.831
Nothing like this
has ever happened

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:46.900
to this extent
in Waukesha County.

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.601
You can't believe
it's your own community,

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:51.471
you can't believe it's
your own friends and family.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:55.708
(screams) (gunshots)

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:58.243
JESSE: Police are
quickly alerted

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:00.747
